&lt;p&gt;    ---- issue&lt;br/&gt;
    When you press the Shift + Ctrl + Space key.&lt;br/&gt;
    Code auto-completion feature, it must work.&lt;br/&gt;
    But it does not operate normally,&lt;br/&gt;
    Only the first line of action.&lt;br/&gt;
    &amp;#8212;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    cause.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    When the operation by the user to request a code completion,&lt;br/&gt;
    Front web Autocomplete target code is not properly transmitted.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Therefore, Frontweb of Paragraph - Fixed Completion parts.&lt;/p&gt;



